    ("DI MCQ: In a table, Company A has revenue $400k and profit $60k; Company B has revenue $600k and profit $72k. Which has higher profit margin?", "Option A is correct. Margin A = 60/400 = 15%. Margin B = 72/600 = 12%. Company A is higher.", "Easy", "MCQ", "", {"A": "Company A (15%)", "B": "Company B (12%)", "C": "Both are equal", "D": "Cannot be determined"}, "A", "What is profit margin formula?"),
    ("A factory produces 1,200 widgets per day with a defect rate of 2.5%. How many non-defective widgets are produced daily?", "1,170 widgets. Defective widgets = 2.5% of 1200 = 0.025 * 1200 = 30. Non-defective = 1200 - 30 = 1,170 widgets (or 97.5% of 1200 = 1170).", "Easy", "Problem Solving", "", "How many defects in a 5-day week?"),
